      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRAY GROUPER (5) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (25.54) at Shepparton. Solid record here at this trip including five wins. Has ability and can bounce back. IT'S BUBBLE TIME (1) crossed over from out wide but caught the leaders turning before drawing clear to score (28.25) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 500m. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Expected to measure up again. MISS MY BROTHER (2) has a strong record this journey here with three wins and a minor from seven starts. In the money last time at this track (24.30) in a Grade 5, finishing a 2.5 lengths third. Looks a key chance on best figures. HARTLAND ROCKET (3) is worth consideration.",
